  examLogisticsProse: 'Cambridge IGCSE and A-Level examinations for Taiwanese students are hosted at Taipei European School (TES) British section in Shilin Taipei — the primary authorised Cambridge International examination centre in Taiwan. Hong Wen International School (HWIS) Tanzi District Taichung also operates as an authorised Cambridge test centre plus College Board AP + SAT + IELTS test centre. Hsinchu, Kaohsiung, and Taoyuan Cambridge candidates travel to Taipei or Taichung by High Speed Rail (35 minutes Hsinchu-Taipei, 55 minutes Taipei-Taichung, 90 minutes Taipei-Kaohsiung). Smartious handles examination registration logistics. Pearson Edexcel International GCSE and International A-Level offer three examination series each year providing greater flexibility than Cambridge\'s two series.',
