  universitiesInCountry: 'National Taiwan University (NTU, top public research), National Taiwan Normal University (NTNU), National Tsing Hua University (NTHU, Hsinchu), National Yang Ming Chiao Tung University (NYCU, Hsinchu — 2021 merger of NCTU and NYMU), National Cheng Kung University (NCKU, Tainan), National Chung Hsing University (NCHU, Taichung), National Sun Yat-sen University (NSYSU, Kaohsiung), National Chengchi University (Taipei), Fu Jen Catholic University, Soochow University Taiwan, Chinese Culture University, Chung Hua University (Hsinchu), Kainan University (Taoyuan), Chung Yuan Christian University (Zhongli Taoyuan), E-Da University (Kaohsiung).',
  universityChannels: 'Taiwan universities accept Cambridge A-Level, IB Diploma, and American AP via international admissions channels (English-medium tracks). UK UCAS applications supported through Cambridge A-Level or IB Diploma, US Common Application via SAT/ACT + AP portfolios (particularly relevant for Taiwan\'s strong US university placement pattern), Canadian OUAC via Ontario OSSD (CCIS partnership) or as international student via Cambridge/IB, Australian direct entry via A-Level or IB. TCS Experimental in New Taipei Linkou offers distinctive Canadian BC Ministry of Education dual diploma pathway; Smartious provides parallel Ontario OSSD pathway. Personalised university guidance sessions with the Head of Academics for target-university strategy.',
  cambridgeCardDescription: 'Smartious\'s primary offer for Taiwanese and expat families. Cambridge IGCSE (Years 10-11) and Cambridge A-Level (Years 12-13) delivered as live online classes with afternoon delivery matching Taiwan school-day rhythm. Private candidate examination registration at Taipei European School (TES) British section or Hong Wen International School Taichung as authorised Cambridge test centres. Pathway accepted by all Taiwan universities, UK Russell Group, US Ivy League, Canadian U15, Australian Group of Eight.',
  britishCurriculumSuits: 'Taiwanese and expat families targeting Cambridge IGCSE + A-Level pathway. Taiwan\'s dominant international curriculum is American (TAS, Morrison Academy, KAS, TYAS, HAS) with British/IB as smaller segment (TES British section, HWIS Taichung, I-Shou Kaohsiung, Acton Academy Taipei) — Smartious extends full Cambridge access alongside American AP alternative. Best fit for UK Russell Group, Canadian and Australian universities, or Taiwan universities via international admissions.',
  britishCurriculumDelivery: 'Live online classes CST 2 PM – 5 PM (matching 9 AM – 12 PM Nairobi teaching), small groups 4-6 students. Cambridge examinations at TES Taipei or HWIS Taichung.',
  ibDiplomaSuits: 'Taiwanese and expat families targeting IB Diploma\'s breadth. IBSH Hsinchu (restricted to Science Park families), TES IB Diploma, I-Shou International Kaohsiung, HWIS Taichung alternative. Best fit for families targeting US Ivy League, Canadian U15, and holistic university applications.',
  ibDiplomaDelivery: 'Live online IB DP classes across all six subject groups plus Theory of Knowledge and Extended Essay supervision.',
  americanCurriculumSuits: 'Taiwanese and expat families targeting US universities via Common Application. Taiwan\'s dominant international curriculum — TAS, Morrison Academy Taichung/Linkou/Kaohsiung, KAS, TYAS, HAS all deliver American curriculum. Smartious American AP alternative includes AP Chinese Language and Culture particularly relevant for returning Taiwanese-American families.',
  americanCurriculumDelivery: 'American Curriculum with AP courses Grades 9-12, SAT/ACT preparation, Common App essay coaching.',
  founderBioCountrySpecific: 'Alfred Ouko founded Smartious in 2019 to make international qualifications (Cambridge, IB, American, Ontario OSSD) accessible to families across emerging markets at online-delivery fees. Taiwanese and expat families in Taiwan join students in 17 other countries — from Taipei Tianmu to Kuwait City Sharq, Istanbul Bebek to Cairo Zamalek, Dubai Downtown to Kuala Lumpur Mont Kiara.',
  founderUniversitySpecialism: 'Alfred holds a BEd in Mathematics and Physics — Smartious\'s Cambridge A-Level and IB Diploma STEM subjects are led personally when needed. Head of Academics supervises curriculum delivery and university placement strategy per family.',

  competitorsIntro: 'Taiwan international school fees span bilingual experimental (NTD 300,000/year, ~USD 9,375) through mid-tier premium (NTD 580,000-950,000/year, USD 18,000-30,000) to premium (NTD 950,000-1,250,000+/year, USD 30,000-39,000+). Taiwan\'s international schools are 25-40% cheaper than Singapore and 30-45% cheaper than Hong Kong equivalents, but still substantial. Taipei American School (TAS) anchors the premium tier alongside Taipei European School (TES). Hsinchu Science Park has HAS + IBSH. Taichung has Morrison Academy + Hong Wen IS. Kaohsiung has KAS + I-Shou. Taoyuan has TYAS. Cambridge access is via TES British section as primary examination centre plus HWIS Taichung.',
